# Written for you by `node setup.mjs`. This file is only a reference.
#
# SECRETS AND ENDPOINTS ONLY. Everything you tune day to day — target wallets,
# trade size, fees, hold time — lives in config.json and on the /sniper page.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WALLET — a burner. Fund it with what you can lose today and nothing else.
# This never leaves the machine. It is not readable from the web panel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRIVATE_KEY=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FEED — the one that decides whether this makes or loses money.
# A plain RPC websocket hands you the block AFTER it is built, so you fire one
# slot late, and one slot costs ~13.5% of an ~18% move.
#   Chainstack Yellowstone   from $49/mo
#   rpc edge Trader          from $249/mo
#   Shyft                    $199 / $349 / $649
#   Helius LaserStream       $499/mo (own SDK, not Yellowstone-compatible)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RPC_URL=""
GRPC_URL=""
GRPC_TOKEN=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RELAYS — express lanes to the validator. Send to all at once; duplicates are
# dropped by the network, so there is no downside. Get the CURRENT tip accounts
# from each provider's docs — they change.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOZOMI_URL=""
NOZOMI_TIP=""
ASTRALANE_URL=""
ASTRALANE_TIP=""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PANEL (optional) — poll your deployed app for settings, so you can change
# size, fees and targets from your phone without touching the server.
# SNIPER_TOKEN must match the one set on the web app.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PANEL_URL=""
SNIPER_TOKEN=""
